#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:42
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Libxcrypt"
msgstr "Instalação do Libxcrypt"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:44
#, xml-text
msgid "First, make a fix required by glibc-2.43 and later:"
msgstr "Primeiro, faça uma correção exigida pela glibc-2.43 e posteriores:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:46
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '/strchr/s/const//' "
"lib/crypt-{sm3,gost}-yescrypt.c</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '/strchr/s/const//' "
"lib/crypt-{sm3,gost}-yescrypt.c</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:48
#, xml-text
msgid "Prepare Libxcrypt for compilation:"
msgstr "Prepare Libxcrypt para compilação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:50
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr                \\\n"
"            --enable-hashes=strong,glibc \\\n"
"            --enable-obsolete-api=no     \\\n"
"            --disable-static             \\\n"
"            --disable-failure-tokens</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr                \\\n"
"            --enable-hashes=strong,glibc \\\n"
"            --enable-obsolete-api=no     \\\n"
"            --disable-static             \\\n"
"            --disable-failure-tokens</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:57
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the new configure options:"
msgstr "O significado das novas opções de configuração:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:60
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--enable-hashes=strong,glibc</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--enable-hashes=strong,glibc</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:62
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Build strong hash algorithms recommended for security use cases, and the "
"hash algorithms provided by traditional Glibc <systemitem "
"class='library'>libcrypt</systemitem> for compatibility."
msgstr ""
"Constrói algoritmos fortes de resumo recomendados para casos de uso de "
"segurança e os algoritmos de resumo fornecidos pela tradicional <systemitem "
"class='library'>libcrypt</systemitem> da \"Glibc\" para compatibilidade."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:70
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--enable-obsolete-api=no</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--enable-obsolete-api=no</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:72
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Disable obsolete API functions.  They are not needed for a modern Linux "
"system built from source."
msgstr ""
"Desabilita as funções obsoletas da API. Elas não são necessárias para um "
"sistema moderno Linux construído a partir do fonte."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:78
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--disable-failure-tokens</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--disable-failure-tokens</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:80
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Disable failure token feature.  It's needed for compatibility with the "
"traditional hash libraries of some platforms, but a Linux system based on "
"Glibc does not need it."
msgstr ""
"Desabilita o recurso de ficha de falha. É necessário para compatibilidade "
"com as bibliotecas tradicionais de resumo de algumas plataformas, mas um "
"sistema Linux baseado na \"Glibc\" não precisa dele."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:88
#, xml-text
msgid "Compile the package:"
msgstr "Compile o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:90
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:92
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue:"
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:94
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"test\">make check</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"test\">make check</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:96
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the package:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:98
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"install\">make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"install\">make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The instructions above disabled obsolete API functions since no package "
"installed by compiling from sources would link against them at runtime. "
"However, the only known binary-only applications that link against these "
"functions require ABI version 1.  If you must have such functions because of"
" some binary-only application or to be compliant with LSB, build the package"
" again with the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"As instruções acima desabilitaram funções obsoletas da API, pois nenhum "
"pacote instalado por compilação a partir dos fontes se vincularia a elas em "
"tempo de execução. No entanto, os únicos aplicativos somente binários "
"conhecidos que se vinculam a essas funções exigem ABI versão 1. Se você "
"precisar ter tais funções devido a algum aplicativo somente binário ou para "
"estar conforme com a \"LSB\", [então] construa o pacote novamente com os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/libxcrypt.xml:110
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make distclean\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr                \\\n"
"            --enable-hashes=strong,glibc \\\n"
"            --enable-obsolete-api=glibc  \\\n"
"            --disable-static             \\\n"
"            --disable-failure-tokens\n"
"make\n"
"cp -av --remove-destination .libs/libcrypt.so.1* /usr/lib</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make distclean\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr                \\\n"
"            --enable-hashes=strong,glibc \\\n"
"            --enable-obsolete-api=glibc  \\\n"
"            --disable-static             \\\n"
"            --disable-failure-tokens\n"
"make\n"
"cp -av --remove-destination .libs/libcrypt.so.1* /usr/lib</userinput>"

